flowchart TB
    INTERNET[Internet / public users] --> DNS[Public DNS]
    DNS --> WAF[SafeLine WAF]
    WAF --> WEB[Nginx reverse proxy / web EC2]
    WEB --> EXT[React + Vite external frontend]
    WEB --> API[Node.js + Express API / PM2]
    API --> DB[(PostgreSQL / private access)]
    STAFF[Authorized staff] --> VPN[OpenVPN]
    VPN --> INT[Intranet frontend]
    INT --> IAPI[Intranet Node.js + Express API]
    IAPI --> DB
    WAF -. WAF events .-> SIEM[Splunk Enterprise]
    WEB -. Access/error logs .-> SIEM
    IDS[Suricata IPS/IDS] -. Network events .-> SIEM
    XDR[Bitdefender GravityZone] -. Endpoint telemetry .-> SIEM
    SIEM --> ML[Python anomaly analysis: WAF + IPS/IDS]
    ML --> OUT[JSON anomaly events]
    OUT --> SIEM
    SIEM -. Ticket automation: verify .-> ZAM[Zammad Service Desk]
    HONEY[T-Pot honeypot] -. Attack observation .-> EVIDENCE[Investigation evidence]
